{"id":"45c72594bfcac15d","group":"56","path":"56/56-cor-equational-model-completeness.md","title":"等式语法与模型接口补记","display":"cor-equational-model-completeness — 等式语法与模型接口补记","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-cor-equational-model-completeness","aliases":["56-cor-equational-model-completeness"],"display":"cor-equational-model-completeness — 等式语法与模型接口补记","depends_on":["[[56-df-birkhoff-completeness]]","[[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]"],"reconstructed":"2026-10-19","reconstruction_basis":"supplied-book-56-files","historical_record_status":"original-record-not-supplied"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-cor-equational-model-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-cor-equational-model-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-equational-model-completeness — 等式语法与模型接口补记"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3d7d3e1543060f95\" href=\"?note=3d7d3e1543060f95\" title=\"56-df-birkhoff-completeness\">56-df-birkhoff-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df0697d1c421b1e1\" href=\"?note=df0697d1c421b1e1\" title=\"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness\">56-thm-birkhoff-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"reconstructed","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"reconstruction_basis","html":"supplied-book-56-files"},{"key":"historical_record_status","html":"original-record-not-supplied"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。等式闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 和项解释采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3d7d3e1543060f95\" href=\"?note=3d7d3e1543060f95\" title=\"56-df-birkhoff-completeness\">56-df-birkhoff-completeness</a> 及其显式上游；完备性结论采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df0697d1c421b1e1\" href=\"?note=df0697d1c421b1e1\" title=\"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness\">56-thm-birkhoff-completeness</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 是集合论元语言中对全部非空集合的量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 在具有指定元数的全运算族中取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\operatorname{BirkhoffComplete}(\\Sigma,V,E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\operatorname{BirkhoffComplete}(\\Sigma,V,E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left[\ns\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t\n\\iff\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;s^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\n\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left[\ns\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t\n\\iff\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;s^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\n\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点保留输入修订补记中已给出的数学断言，并依其数学内容规范名称及类型。原文件的历史重建信息仍记录在元数据中；数学含义由前两段和所列第 56 本内部依赖确定。</p>\n<p>该补记连接等式闭包、所有赋值的模型满足与 Birkhoff 定理。定义节点只定义完备性质；普遍成立性由定理节点断言。对非空载体及全运算族的显式量化保证每次模型谓词和项解释求值均处于其定义域内。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3d7d3e1543060f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-birkhoff-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"df0697d1c421b1e1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3d7d3e1543060f95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定签名 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、与 $F$ 不交的可数无限变量集 $V$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。等式闭包 $\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma$ 和项解释采用 [[56-df-birkhoff-completeness]] 及其显式上游；完备性结论采用 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]。$\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing$ 是集合论元语言中对全部非空集合的量词；$I$ 在具有指定元数的全运算族中取值。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"df0697d1c421b1e1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定签名 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、与 $F$ 不交的可数无限变量集 $V$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。等式闭包 $\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma$ 和项解释采用 [[56-df-birkhoff-completeness]] 及其显式上游；完备性结论采用 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]。$\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing$ 是集合论元语言中对全部非空集合的量词；$I$ 在具有指定元数的全运算族中取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\operatorname{BirkhoffComplete}(\\Sigma,V,E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall E\\subseteq T^2\\;\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left[\ns\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}t\n\\iff\n\\forall A\\ne\\varnothing\\;\\forall I\\in\\prod_{f\\in F}A^{A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}}\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{EqModels}_\\Sigma(A,I,E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in A^V\\;s^{(A,I)}[\\beta]=t^{(A,I)}[\\beta]\n\\right)\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1938,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-cor-equational-model-completeness.md]]"}],"outgoing":["3d7d3e1543060f95","df0697d1c421b1e1"]}